their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1439930,\"title\":\"The Punisher: One Last Kill\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qQclTgLMDvGBuUBFGHRipxkEwWR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qO55CD8tgVL1T4WKn6zYFFiD6lL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As Frank Castle searches for meaning beyond revenge, an unexpected force pulls him back into the fight.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272,\"title\":\"Batman Begins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9IIBboV7MCT0bTxzXHmWK1Hq558.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City.  Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7451,\"title\":\"xXx\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xeEw3eLeSFmJgXZzmF2Efww0q3s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwK9soQmmJ7kRdjLZVXblw3g7AQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government \\\"recruits\\\" him to go on a mission, he's not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":75780,\"title\":\"Jack Reacher\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uQBbjrLVsUibWxNDGA4Czzo8lwz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iwvP8XVpYVmJ3xfF9xdBi5uAOWl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One morning in an ordinary town, five people are shot dead in a seemingly random attack. All evidence points to a single suspect: an ex-military sniper who is quickly brought into custody. The interrogation yields one written note: 'Get Jack Reacher!'. Reacher, an enigmatic ex-Army investigator, believes the authorities have the right man but agrees to help the sniper's defense attorney. However, the more Reacher delves into the case, the less clear-cut it appears. So begins an extraordinary chase for the truth, pitting Jack Reacher against an unexpected enemy, with a skill for violence and a secret to keep.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":668489,\"title\":\"Havoc\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r46leE6PSzLR3pnVzaxx5Q30yUF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7rKyFSg6SdLoCRCVoWLjL5k658k.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a drug heist swerves lethally out of control, a jaded cop fights his way through a corrupt city's criminal underworld to save a politician's son.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":348893,\"title\":\"Boyka: Undisputed IV\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7QGdIJWWTkPhVjpQ0zA6z69khod.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tCsYQTkQx7vknDmTw666K1XxAdx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the fourth installment of the fighting franchise, Boyka is shooting for the big leagues when an accidental death in the ring makes him question everything he stands for. When he finds out the wife of the man he accidentally killed is in trouble, Boyka offers to fight in a series of impossible battles to free her from a life of servitude.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":646097,\"title\":\"Rebel Ridge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xEt2GSz9z5rSVpIHMiGdtf0czyf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cyKH7pDFlxIXluqRyNoHHEpxSDX.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former Marine confronts corruption in a small town when local law enforcement unjustly seizes the bag of cash he needs to post his cousin's bail.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":136797,\"title\":\"Need for Speed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ktdbrhCnAoDGLW36afjB717Sa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/syVAWAnY6fTBDDFntHsM8vFjKex.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The film revolves around a local street-racer who partners with a rich and arrogant business associate, only to find himself framed by his colleague and sent to prison. After he gets out, he joins a New York-to-Los Angeles race to get revenge. But when the ex-partner learns of the scheme, he puts a massive bounty on the racer's head, forcing him to run a cross-country gauntlet of illegal racers in all manner of supercharged vehicles.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Si6oljECivQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Dab4MlXsQeE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"DE7piXWLw7I\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}